// The dashboard chat agent. Render as: sequence-diagram
typeface clean

Browser [icon: monitor, color: gray, label: "Dashboard (browser)"]
Chat [icon: message-square, color: purple, label: "Gateway: /api/chat"]
Mcp [icon: node, color: purple, label: "Gateway: /mcp"]
LLM [icon: gemini, color: blue, label: "LLM"]
Upstreams [icon: server, color: green, label: "Upstream MCP servers"]

Browser > Chat: question, with the dashboard session cookie
activate Chat
Chat > Chat: mint a short-lived token for this user
Chat > Mcp: connect as the user, tools/list
Mcp --> Chat: only the tools this user may call
loop [label: "until the model answers, at most 8 steps", color: blue] {
  Chat > LLM: conversation + tool list
  LLM --> Chat: tool calls
  Chat > Mcp: tools/call, as the user
  Mcp > Upstreams: routed call
  Upstreams --> Mcp: result
  Mcp --> Chat: result, audited under the user with via = chat
  Chat --> Browser: tool_call and tool_result events
}
LLM --> Chat: final answer
Chat --> Browser: message event
deactivate Chat
